1. Code derived from DualView (adfi-openclaw)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mandu is the OS-level generalization of DualView (https://github.com/compsec-snu/dualview,
the "adfi-openclaw" OpenClaw plugin), by Juhee Kim, Woohyuk Choi, Taehyun Kang,
Youngmin Kim and Byoungyoung Lee. The DualView authors have agreed (2026-10-09)
that the DualView code carried into Mandu is licensed here under the same
Apache-2.0 terms as the rest of this repository. Each file below keeps a
provenance header naming its DualView origin (the reuse convention in CONTRIBUTING.md).

