2. Enterprise components (not open source)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SIEM integration (a Wazuh rig and a redacting event exporter) is on the
enterprise side of the open-core line. It is not part of the open-source
release, is not covered by the root LICENSE, and carries its own LICENSE
(docs/design/distribution/licensing.md §6).

